  "provision": "The source composition installs the linux-x64 binary (.github/composition/install-toolchains.sh) and exports its path as LIBRE_AI_CARGO_DENY; tools/quality/check-dependency-policy.ts uses that binary and refuses to download when it is declared. Archive digests are the digests the release API reports for each asset, checked on the downloaded archives; executable digests were measured on the extracted binaries. No darwin-x64 entry: upstream publishes no macOS Intel archive since 0.21.0, and the gate fails on that platform rather than building or fetching an unpinned binary."
